<p>Aeolian	     2.8	  82.5%    -14.4%</p>
<p>Piraeus Invest    5.6	  80.2%	3.3%</p>
<p>Development Fund  2.7	  78.3%     -8.4%</p>
<p>Exelixi	     1.2	  71.4%    -20.0%</p>
<p>Alpha Invest     51.8	  59.9%     16.9%</p>
<p>Ergo Invest	27.7	  59.5%     -2.4%</p>
<p>Medinvest	   0.6	  55.6%    -20.4%</p>
<p>Ionian Invest     3.8	  48.0%     10.4%</p>
